'''Horde of Tank Cats''' (タンクネコたちの逆襲, ''Tanku Neko tachi no Gyakushū'', '''Revenge of the Tank Cats''') is an event added in the [[Version 12.1 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Horde of Tank Cats will reset when the event ends. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cat]].

==Overview==
===About===
Horde of Tank Cats contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The reward for stages 1~5 is the [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] [[Killer Tank Cat (Rare Cat)|Killer Tank Cat]], and there are various [[Timed Score Reward]]s in all stages.

